## 1. Overview

Spark Technologies is proposing the deployment of the **AAAH AI Progress Monitoring Module** as a standalone on-premise solution — the most immediately impactful component of the full AAAH platform.

This module connects to your **existing site cameras** and uses AI to automatically track construction progress, update activity completion, and flag delays — without any manual data entry from the site team. The same cameras that monitor safety are also used to track progress, making full use of your existing infrastructure.

This document covers:
- The equipment needed to run the module
- What data and access AAAH Holding Corp needs to provide
- What information is needed to train the AI for your specific projects

> **PoC Scope:** 1–2 active project sites, up to 100 users, 10 users running AI features at the same time.

---

## 2. What the Module Does

| Feature | Description |
|---|---|
| **Zone Completion Tracking** | The AI watches your camera feeds and recognises when a construction milestone is reached — such as a slab being poured or columns being completed — and marks the zone accordingly |
| **Automatic Schedule Updates** | When a milestone is detected, the corresponding activity in your project schedule is updated automatically |
| **Planned vs Actual Progress (S-Curve)** | A real-time graph showing how actual site progress compares to your planned schedule |
| **Delay Detection & Alerts** | The system automatically identifies which activities are behind and by how many days |
| **Site Map View** | A colour-coded map of the site showing which zones are done, in progress, delayed, or not yet started |
| **Schedule Performance Metrics** | Automatically calculates key project health indicators like SPI and Schedule Variance |
| **Drone Integration (Optional)** | Drone survey images can be added for a more detailed, high-accuracy progress view |

---

## 3. How It Works

```
Your Existing Site Cameras
           │
           ▼
    AI reads the live feeds
    (running on your server)
           │
     ┌─────┴──────┐
     ▼            ▼
Safety Alerts   Progress Tracking
(PPE, access)   (Zone milestones,
                 WBS updates)
           │
           ▼
  Progress Dashboard
  (S-Curve, KPIs, Delay Alerts)
```

> **One camera — two uses.** The same camera that monitors safety also feeds into the progress tracking AI. No additional cameras needed.

