## 8. Drone Integration — Optional

The module is fully built to accept drone survey data as an optional addition — at any time, without any changes to the server or software.

| | Without Drone | With Drone |
|---|---|---|
| **How progress is tracked** | AI reads your existing cameras | AI also reads aerial drone images of the site |
| **Accuracy** | Good (~65–70%) | Very High (~90–95%) |
| **Comparison against building design** | Not available | AI compares what has been built against the original design |
| **What it costs extra** | Nothing | Drone flight service (arranged separately by AAAH) |

> AAAH can hire a drone flight service on a per-visit basis. No platform changes or extra hardware are needed.

